OpenOutreach
============

This product includes software developed as part of cold-cli
(https://github.com/andersmyrmel/cold-cli), Copyright (c) Anders Myrmel,
licensed under the MIT License.

OpenOutreach keeps the Go module path `github.com/andersmyrmel/cold-cli` so
upstream merges stay clean. Product branding, hosted control plane, Worker,
dashboard, and MCP layers are OpenOutreach additions.
